OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies 'devastated' as school
OL,4,Aclosure announced
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies have been left "absolutely
OL,7,Fdevastated" by a decision to close a
OL,8,Fprimary school in Greater Manchester.
OL,10,FSt Teresa's RC Primary School in
OL,11,FFirwsood, Trafford, will close down in
OL,12,FAugust 2027.
OL,14,FOne mother told the BBC she feared she
OL,15,Fmight not be able to get a place for
OL,16,Fher daughter at another local Roman
OL,17,FCatholic school.
OL,19,FThe council said falling pupil numbers
OL,20,Fhad made the school's finances
OL,21,Funsustainable.
